## Verification

- GreenLight continuous year, track-B tomato design (Girvan): heat ours 182.4 vs GreenLight 158.3 kWh/m2 (ratio 1.153, monthly r 1.00); yield relative to the Westland reference ours 0.971 vs GreenLight 0.934. Earlier (R7) Caledonian 8.5 ha: heat ratio 0.95.
- Regression tests (results/test_regress_R10.log): test_reproduce PASS, test_fast PASS, test_r6_options PASS, test_costing PASS
- tests/test_r10.py (28 checks): electricity routes, no-waste track, wind cap, ledger, cold-year LP sizing, cash-flow arithmetic.

## Costing inputs added for the full costing

| Input | Value | Unit | Tier | Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| ramp | 0.8 | - | estimate | year-1 output vs full (first crop establishment; Dutch practice for new houses) |
| dev_frac | 0.05 | of capex | estimate | design, planning, legal, site investigation (feasibility-stage allowance) |
| contingency | 0.1 | of capex | estimate | feasibility-stage contingency (estimate class 4, +-30 %) |
| import_conn_gbp | 150000.0 | GBP | sourced (range) | 11 kV connection near a substation GBP 50-150k (solargridcheck.co.uk G99 guide 2026, DNO averages); upper end |
| overheads_m2 | 3.0 | GBP/m2/yr | placeholder | management, office, certification, accounts (no UK source found) |
| land_gbp_ha | 1000.0 | GBP/ha/yr | placeholder | land rent near an industrial host; Scottish arable rent is ~GBP 250-500/ha, industrial land more |
| commission | 0.05 | of revenue | placeholder | marketing organisation / sales commission, typical 3-8 % |
